---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">About Me!</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-700">
    I’m a Fall 2025 graduate from University at Buffalo (Go Bulls!) with a B.S. in Computer Science interested in AI, 
    programming languages, developer tools, and building practical software.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-700">
    I've lived in many different countries, being born in Seoul, South Korea, and then moved to Malaysia when I was 7.
    I spent 12 years there, and then moved back to Korea for my military service. 
    When I was done with that, I moved to Buffalo, NY to finish my undergraduate studies.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-700">
    I am currently employed at Rupp Pfalzgraf LLC, located in downtown Buffalo as an AI developer.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
    <img
      src="/me2.jpg"
      alt="Alex Doyoon Kim"
      class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <img
      src="/me3.jpg"
      alt="Alex Doyoon Kim"
      class="w-full aspect-square object-cover object-bottom rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <img
      src="/me4.jpg"
      alt="Alex Doyoon Kim"
      class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <img
      src="/me5.jpg"
      alt="Alex Doyoon Kim"
      class="w-full aspect-square object-cover object-bottom rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</Layout>
